# Supabase dashboard setup this app depends on:
#   1. Authentication > Emails > SMTP: add your own SMTP provider. The built-in
#      mailer is capped at ~2 emails/hour project-wide, which breaks signup
#      confirmation and sign-in links under any real traffic.
#   2. Authentication > URL Configuration: add every deploy origin to the
#      redirect allow-list, or confirmation / sign-in links will bounce.
#   3. Authentication > Providers > Email: with "Confirm email" on (the current
#      setting), new accounts cannot sign in until the link is clicked.
